B.ZR=s(["K\u0131\u015f mevsiminde veya Zud uyar\u0131s\u0131 geldi\u011finde donan binan\u0131za dokunun.",'Alt men\xfcde k\u0131rm\u0131z\u0131 yanan "B\u0130NAYI ISIT" butonuna bas\u0131n.',"Odun veya ke\xe7e harcayarak binan\u0131n donmas\u0131n\u0131 engelleyin."],t.s)
B.a_T=s(["During winter/Zud alert, tap on any frozen building.","Tap the glowing HEAT BUILDING action button in the sheet.","Spend wood/felt to keep the building warm and operational."],t.s)
B.ZW=s(["Sonbahar aylar\u0131nda odun harcamay\u0131 k\u0131s\u0131p k\u0131\u015f i\xe7in en az 200 odun stoku yap\u0131n."],t.s)
B.ZY=s(["Save at least 200 wood during autumn to survive winter heating demands."],t.s)
B.a03=s(["mevsim","k\u0131\u015f","zud","\u0131s\u0131nma","bahar","yaz","donma","seasons","winter"],t.s)
B.SO=new A.bw("seasons_zud_mechanic",B.pN,"4 Mevsim D\xf6ng\xfcs\xfc, K\u0131\u015f & Zud Afeti","4 Seasons, Winter & Severe Zud Frost","Bahar\u0131n ekiminden yaz\u0131n hasad\u0131na; k\u0131\u015f\u0131n dondurucu zud ayaz\u0131nda binalar\u0131 \u0131s\u0131tma takti\u011fi.","From spring planting to summer harvests, protect buildings with heat during harsh winter Zud.",'Her mevsim 60 saniye s\xfcrer (1 Y\u0131l = 4 Mevsim = 240sn):\n\n\u2022 Bahar: Ekim mevsimi; tarla maliyetleri d\xfc\u015fer, fidanlar co\u015far.\n\u2022 Yaz: Hasat zirvesi; t\xfcm tar\u0131m ve bal\u0131k\xe7\u0131l\u0131k +%50 daha h\u0131zl\u0131 \xfcretir.\n\u2022 Sonbahar: Stok ve pazar bereketi; ticaret gelirleri artar.\n\u2022 K\u0131\u015f & Zud Afeti: Dondurucu ayaz ba\u015flar. Zud vurdu\u011funda \u0131s\u0131t\u0131lmayan binalar donar (%0 verim). Karoya dokunup "ISIT" butonuna basarak Odun ve Ke\xe7e ile binay\u0131 donmaktan koruyabilirsiniz.',"Seasons cycle every 60s. Winter brings severe Zud frost where unheated buildings freeze (0% yield). Heat them using Wood and Felt to sustain output.",B.pQ,B.fz,"\u0130KL\u0130M & ZUD",B.a4e,B.ZR,B.a_T,B.ZW,B.ZY,B.a03)
