B.SV=new A.bw("defense_tile_repair",B.jr,"Sava\u015f Hasar\u0131 & Karo Onar\u0131m\u0131","War Damage & Hex Repairs","D\xfc\u015fmanlar\u0131n \xe7i\u011fnedi\u011fi karolar tahrip olur (%50 \xfcretim kayb\u0131). Yar\u0131 maliyetle onar\u0131larak tam kapasiteye d\xf6nd\xfcr\xfcl\xfcr.","Tiles trampled by enemy raiders suffer war damage (-50% output). Repair them at half cost to restore full production.","Bozk\u0131r ak\u0131n\u0131nda d\xfc\u015fmanlar\u0131n \xfczerinden ge\xe7ti\u011fi karolar tahrip edilir ve sar\u0131 duman sinyali yaymaya ba\u015flar. Hasarl\u0131 karolardaki yap\u0131lar %50 \xfcretim cezas\u0131 al\u0131r. Hasarl\u0131 karoya dokunuldu\u011funda alt men\xfcde sar\u0131 renkli ONAR butonu belirir ve bina y\xfckseltme maliyetinin sadece %50'si harcanarak karo an\u0131nda tamir edilir ve %100 tam \xfcretim kapasitesine geri d\xf6ner.","During raids, hex tiles traversed by enemies become damaged, emitting yellow warning smoke and suffering a 50% production penalty. Tapping a damaged hex reveals a REPAIR button in the action sheet, allowing instant restoration to 100% capacity at only 50% of the building upgrade cost.",B.TT,B.U,"ONARIM / HASAR",B.a4j,B.Zl,B.a1A,B.a1_,B.a_c,B.a1r)
