B.T0=new A.bw("core_castle",B.jq,"Ka\u011fan Ota\u011f\u0131 & \u0130lerleme","Khan's Tent & Progression","Ka\u011fanl\u0131\u011f\u0131n kalbi. Ota\u011f y\xfckseldik\xe7e yeni teknolojiler, binalar ve k\xfcresel h\u0131z \xe7arpan\u0131 a\xe7\u0131l\u0131r.","The core of the Khaganate. Upgrading the Tent unlocks new buildings, lore tiers, and speed boosts.","Ka\u011fan Ota\u011f\u0131, haritan\u0131n merkezindeki (0,0) ana karodur. Her seviye art\u0131\u015f\u0131, t\xfcm ka\u011fanl\u0131k \xfcretimine kal\u0131c\u0131 %15 \xe7arpan kazand\u0131r\u0131r ve Seviye 2'de T\xf6re Meclisi, Seviye 3'te Maden ve F\u0131r\u0131nlar, Seviye 4'te \xc7\xf6l/Tundra derin yap\u0131lar\u0131, Seviye 5'te ise Efsanevi Obsidyen ve G\xf6ksel Ocaklar a\xe7\u0131l\u0131r.","The Khan's Tent is the central hex tile (0,0). Each level gives a permanent +15% Khaganate production boost and unlocks new building tiers up to Level 50.",B.q1,B.p,"\u015eATO / MERKEZ",B.a3x,B.a1c,B.a0H,B.a0v,B.a22,B.a_O)
