B.a1N=s(["Harita \xfczerinde bir \xc7ay\u0131r karosu se\xe7in.","Etraf\u0131ndaki 6 kom\u015fu karodan en az 2'sini Orman, 1'ini Sazl\u0131k yapacak \u015fekilde fethedin.",'Merkez karoda otomatik olarak "VAH\u015e\u0130 KORULUK" rozetinin yand\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 g\xf6r\xfcn.'],t.s)
B.a1k=s(["Select a Meadow hex on the map.","Conquer neighboring tiles to place at least 2 Forests and 1 Wetland around it.",'The central tile will automatically mutate into a "WILD GLADE".'],t.s)
