B.a0N=s(["A\xe7\u0131kta duran ancak hen\xfcz fethedilmemi\u015f bir kom\u015fu karoya dokunun.","Gerekli G\u0131da miktar\u0131n\u0131 alt panelden teyit edin.","TOPRA\u011eI FETHET butonuna basarak karoyu ka\u011fanl\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131za kat\u0131n."],t.s)
